OL,3,GNEWSA'Alcohol ruled my life ` now my
OL,4,Aeyes are open'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA recovering alcoholic who says he once
OL,7,Fdrank up to 23 cans of beer a day has
OL,8,Ftold how volunteering helped him
OL,9,Frebuild his life after years of
OL,10,Faddiction.
OL,12,FDaniel Norrish, 57, from Swindon,
OL,13,FWiltshire, said his drinking spiralled
OL,14,Fafter he was made redundant during the
OL,15,FCovid pandemic, leaving him drinking
OL,16,Fbeer and spirits from morning until
OL,17,Fnight.
OL,19,FNow two years sober, Norrish volunteers
OL,20,Ffor FoodCycle Swindon ` a charity that
OL,21,Fturns surplus supermarket food into
OL,22,Ffree community meals.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
