OL,5,
OL,6,F"With Daniel it's such a great reminder
OL,7,Fthat when you show kindness to others
OL,8,Fit can have a kind of ripple effect,"
OL,9,Fsaid Jemma Pembury, regional manager
OL,10,Ffor the charity.
